{"title": "Infernal Retribution", "pageid": 20658, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Infernal_Retribution", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Infernal Retribution</b> is a passive feature that burns an attacker whenever the wearer succeeds a Saving Throw.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When you succeed a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a>, the caster receives <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Orthonic)_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Orthonic) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Orthonic)_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Orthonic) (Condition)\">Burning</a> for 3 turns. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span id=\"Condition:_Burning_.28Orthonic.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Burning_(Orthonic)\"> Condition: Burning (Orthonic) </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Orthonic)_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Orthonic) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Orthonic)_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Orthonic) (Condition)\">Burning</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 3  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage per turn.</li>\n<li><b>CANNOT</b> be removed with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Help\" title=\"Help\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/25px-Help_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/38px-Help_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/50px-Help_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Help\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/25px-Help_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/89/Help_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Help\" title=\"Help\">Help</a> action, using a <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Healing\" title=\"Potion of Healing\">Healing Type Potion</a> or gaining <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wet_(Condition)\" title=\"Wet (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wet\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wet_(Condition)\" title=\"Wet (Condition)\">Wet</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helldusk_Armour\" title=\"Helldusk Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Helldusk_Armour\" title=\"Helldusk Armour\">Helldusk Armour</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\">Raphael</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li><b>Infernal Retribution</b> states it applies <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\">Burning</a>, but it actually applies <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Orthonic)_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Orthonic) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burning (Orthonic)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Orthonic)_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Orthonic) (Condition)\">Burning (Orthonic)</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">On a successful <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving throw\">save</a>, inflicts <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Orthonic)_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Orthonic) (Condition)\">Burning</a> on the caster that forced the save.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200000\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.069 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.078 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2229/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 23917/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6980/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 124/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.025/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 965054/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   68.869      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   68.869      1 -total\n 25.92%   17.852      3 Template:SmCond\n 22.78%   15.687      5 Template:Icon_text\n 20.39%   14.046     18 Template:Trim\n 15.26%   10.511      1 Template:Condition\n 14.23%    9.798      7 Template:Ifempty\n 14.21%    9.783      1 Template:Saving_Throw\n 13.59%    9.358      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 10.96%    7.550      4 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:20658-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714200000 and revision id 373470. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\